    {
      "text": "You can remediate Active Directory (AD) identities directly from the Zscaler ITDR Admin Portal. Remediating risky AD identities improves the security posture of the AD domain. You can remediate a specific or multiple AD identities (in bulk)."
    },
    {
      "text": "Before taking remediation actions against risky AD identities, you must configure a server agent. The server agent runs these remediation actions in the background via single or multiple API calls."
    },
    {
      "text": "The following remediation actions can be taken from the ITDR Admin Portal:"
    },
    {
      "table": [
        [
          "Remediation Action Name",
          "Action Description",
          "Bulk Remediation Supported?"
        ],
        [
          "Disable User",
          "Disables the AD user account.",
          "Yes"
        ],
        [
          "Enable User",
          "Enables the AD user account.",
          "Yes"
        ],
        [
          "Reset Password",
          "Enforces a password change on the next login for the AD user account.",
          "Yes"
        ],
        [
          "Revoke Group Membership",
          "Removes the AD user account from a specific group. Only users from the static privilege group can be removed. If a user is not a member of the specified group or if the specified group does not exist, no remediation action is taken.",
          "No"
        ]
      ],
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          23
        ],
        [
          0,
          1,
          0,
          18
        ],
        [
          0,
          2,
          0,
          27
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To run remediation actions for AD identities:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to ITDR > Active Directory Posture.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ],
        [
          13,
          37
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Active Directory Posture dashboard:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          31
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select an AD domain from the Result for drop-down menu.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          29,
          39
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select a timestamp from the scanned on drop-down menu.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          28,
          38
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "The scan result for the AD domain appears.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Do one of the following:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Remediate a specific AD identity.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Do one of the following:",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Under Detailed Findings and Recommendations, click an issue.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          43
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Scroll down to the Who is affected? table.",
      "depth": 4,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          19,
          35
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select a specific AD identity and click the Remediate icon.",
      "depth": 4,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          44,
          53
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select an appropriate remediation action. For example, select Revoke Group Membership.",
      "depth": 4,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          62,
          85
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Remove Group Membership window, select the AD groups from which you want to remove the user.",
      "depth": 4,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          30
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 4,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The remediation is applied successfully.",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Under Top 10 Users & Computers, click an AD identity.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          30
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Summary tab, click Actions.",
      "depth": 4,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          14
        ],
        [
          26,
          33
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select an appropriate remediation action. For example, select Reset Password.",
      "depth": 4,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          62,
          76
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "In the confirmation window, click OK.",
      "depth": 4,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          34,
          36
        ]
